			"notes": "- The navigation sidebar can now show deeper levels of the navigation tree. It still shows two levels by default, which\n  pages can change for the levels below them with `max_depth` in their navigation frontmatter (backport of #156)\n- The navigation sidebar highlights the current page and reveals it when navigating. Clicking the arrow next to a page\n  only expands or collapses it, while clicking its title opens the page (backport of #156)\n- Add support for sprite export and pixel manipulation during texture and sprite export (backport of #153)\n- Export the shader pipelines of game scenes to the web export scene format\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AppliedEnergistics/GuideME/compare/v26.1.15-beta...v26.1.16-beta"
		},
